    "details": "<p class=\"blue_un-border-before hdng mock-title\">All that you need to know about Project Jupyter</p>\n<div class=\"position-relative\">\n<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live expanded\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><main>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<article dir=\"auto\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Event Overview</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Purpose:</strong><br />Project Jupyter brings together developers, designers, and problem-solvers to build <strong>innovative solutions using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong>. The event encourages participants to develop creative and impactful projects that address real-world challenges across various domains such as healthcare, education, environment, sustainability, smart cities, and social welfare.</p>\n<p>Participants are free to work on <strong>any project idea or problem statement</strong>, whether it is a global challenge or a local community problem they have identified. The key focus is to create <strong>technology-driven solutions with AI/ML integration</strong> that demonstrate innovation and practical impact.</p>\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong><br />To develop <strong>AI/ML-powered projects and intelligent systems</strong> that solve real-world problems, promote technological innovation, and showcase practical applications of emerging technologies.</p>\n<p><strong>Why You Should Join</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Collaborate:</strong><br />Work alongside innovators, developers, and designers who are passionate about building <strong>cutting edge AI and ML based solutions</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Mentorship:</strong><br />Gain valuable insights and guidance from <strong>industry experts and mentors</strong> in the fields of Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and software development.</p>\n<p><strong>Recognition &amp; Prizes:</strong><br />The best projects will be <strong>featured and rewarded with exciting prizes</strong>, along with opportunities for further development and exposure.</p>\n<p><strong>Impact:</strong><br />Your solution could contribute to <strong>real-world change</strong> by solving meaningful problems through technology.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Get Involved</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Register Now:</strong><br />Don&rsquo;t miss the opportunity to be part of a community of innovators working on <strong>AI-driven projects and impactful technological solutions.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
